          hasPlaceholders: false,
        },
        rules: {
          objective: 'Collect 5 cards of the same suit with the highest possible total value. A perfect hand (Ace, King, Queen, Jack, Ten) equals 51 points.',
          gameplay: "Turns proceed anticlockwise. On your turn, you must choose one of these actions:\n1. Draw & Discard: Draw 1 card from the stock and discard 1 to the table.\n2. Exchange One: Swap 1 card from your hand with 1 facendup card on the table.\n3. Exchange All: Swap your entire 5ndcard hand for the 5 cards on the table.\n4. Call: If your hand is all one suit, you may 'call' and end the round immediatey.",
          keyRules: [
            'Suit Matching: Only cards of the SAME suit in your hand contribute to your score. Mixedndsuit hands score only the value of the highest single suit within them.',
            'Automatic Call: If you reach exactly 51 points, you win the round instantly.',
            'Table Clear: If all 5 cards on the table are cleared, the next player must draw from the stock.',
          ],
          hasPlaceholders: false,
        },
        strategy: {
          basic: "Pick a suit early based on your starting hand and stick to it. Don't be afraid to exchange your whole hand if the table has 3 or 4 cards of a suit you can use.",
          intermediate: 'Deny your opponents: If you see someone collecting Hearts, and there is a Heart Ace on the table, take it even if you are collecting Spades. This prevents them from hitting 51.',
          advanced: "Timing the Table Refresh: If the table is full of 'junk' cards, use the 'Draw & Discard' action to try and force a table clear, giving you a fresh set of facendup options on your next turn.",
          tips: [
            'Aces are the most valuable cards; always prioritize picking them up from the table.',
            "If you 'Call', ensure you have at least 40 points; calling early with a weak 30-point hand often leads to an opponent beating you with a lategame draw.",
          ],
          hasPlaceholders: false,
        },
